Start Your IT Career as a Junior C++ Developer!
At Manpower Bulgaria, we don’t just fill roles - we empower careers.
Manpower Bulgaria is a subsidiary of ManpowerGroup, part of the global network founded in 1948. Operating in over 80 countries worldwide, it is one of the leading and well-established companies in staffing and workforce solutions, serving as a trusted partner for businesses. At Manpower Bulgaria, we don’t just fill roles - we empower careers.
Our trusted partner – a multinational technology leader in microchips, networking equipment, embedded systems, and advanced software solutions is looking for its new Junior C++ Developer!
Your Role:
As a Junior Developer, you will:
Work on both software and hardware aspects of product development;
Participate in embedded systems projects across the full design flow – from RTL to GDSII;
Contribute to test strategies, test design, and validation activities;
Develop and maintain automation scripts using Python;
Collaborate closely with Software Engineering, Physical Design, and Software Testing teams;
Work in an international environment with experts from Silicon Valley and global locations.
What We’re Looking For?
4th year student or recent graduate in Electronics, Computer Science, Communication Technologies, Mathematics, Informatics, Physics, or related fields (BSc, MSc, PhD);
Strong logical and analytical thinking;
Good command of English (spoken and written);
Basic knowledge or interest in embedded C/C++ (considered an advantage, not a requirement);
Motivation to learn and grow in a high-tech, engineering-driven environment.
What’s The Offer?
Opportunity to join a stable multinational organization;
Work alongside top engineers in embedded systems;
Excellent prospects for professional and personal development;
Competitive remuneration package with annual salary reviews;
Additional health insurance and dental care;
Food vouchers;
Sports card and wellness benefits;
Supportive, international, and innovation-focused culture.
Kickstart your career in embedded systems and turn your ambition into action - apply today!
Join us at ManpowerGroup, an Equal Opportunity Employer that values diversity and considers applicants based on skills and expertise, without bias towards gender, nationality, or background.
Manpower Bulgaria holds License № 2033 / 20.04.2016 for providing human resources services.

